The who command has been completely reworked!

The default who list now shows each player's level, class, race, and
current area at a glance. Immortals are displayed with colorized rank
and title. This is all similar to the old who -l

Use 'who <name>' for a detailed view of a specific player, including
their title, group members, and how long they've been online.

A new --brief option shows only names and titles for a minimal,
less spoilery view.

The old single-letter filter flags have been removed. 
Type 'who --help' for the new options.
